Groups and sizes:
  slum 2, hype 2, wash 1, food 1, wheels 2, pills 2, vice 3,
  retail 2, hospitality 1, oil 2, gambling 1, space 2

Every space has >=10 one-line jokes. On land, print one random joke in the log, then resolve the space.


7. MOVEMENT
-----------
Action phase buttons (current human only):
  ROLL, BUY DEED, END TURN, BUY POLITICIAN $250, EXTORT xN

ROLL: two d6. Animate token along each intervening space (~0.4s/space, interpolate draw_pos). Whoosh/step sound per space if audio works.

Passing GO (pos wraps through 0): grant payday $200 * multiplier (once per wrap).

Doubles:
  Increment doubles_streak; non-double resets to 0.
  Three doubles in a row: lose 1 politician if any (no refund), reset streak.

Tokens walk visibly; do not teleport except Chance “advance to GO” and send-to-jail.


8. JAIL
-------
GO TO JAIL or Chance jail: move to jail index, in_jail=True, jail_turns=0, streak=0. Do not collect GO.

Just visiting: land on jail while not imprisoned.

While imprisoned, each ROLL first applies politician bleed if politicians > 18:
  lose max(1, politicians * random(2..7) // 100), no refund.

Then roll:
  Doubles: leave jail, move that many.
  Else jail_turns += 1; after 3 fails pay $50 bail and move the roll.
  Failed break without bail: phase = end (skip action).


9. POLITICIANS
--------------
Buy anytime in action phase for $250 (keep them; they are payroll).
Night club landing: +1 free.
Chance can grant +1.
Informant Alley: +$100 * multiplier; if politicians > 0, lose 1 politician (desert). You still get the fee with 0 politicians.

Politicians:
  Increase rent you charge: rent *= (1 + 0.15 * min(politicians, 8)), then *= payday_mult
  Reduce rent you pay: discount 12% of rent * min(your politicians, 5)
  Resist extortion against you: 20% of base * min(your politicians, 4)
  Extortion charges when you may extort: 1 + (politicians // 2)
    You keep the politicians; this only adds extra shakes per visit/card.
  Emergency slush $80 each when cash would go negative
  Life resource: 0 cash + 0 politicians = lose

Payday multiplier payday_mult, tiers = politicians // 6:
  Start 1.0
  Tier steps in order: ×2, ×2, ×2, ×2 (reaches 16×), then ×1.5, ×1.25, ×1.12, ×1.06, then ×1.01 each further tier
  Table: 0–5:1  6–11:2  12–17:4  18–23:8  24–29:16  30–35:24  36–41:30  42–47:33.6  48–53:35.62  then ×1.01 / 6 pols
Applies to: GO money, Chance cash gains, parking $25, lobby $50, informant $100, steal amount (capped by victim cash), rent charged, extortion take.
Does not apply to taxes, bail, purchase prices, or Chance penalty bills (those stay flat unless specified).


10. PROPERTIES
--------------
Unowned prop: pending_buy = index; player may BUY DEED if cash >= price.
Owned by self: flavor only (casino also forces a gamble).
Owned by other: pay rent as computed; landlord receives it.

Monopoly (own every deed in the group): base rent ×2 before politician juice and payday_mult.

Display on tile: name (wrapped), $price, owner tag P1/P2/AI/—


11. GAMBLING
------------
Street Dice Pit (gamble_fixed): cannot be bought. Always resolve a bet.

Golden Spoon Casino (buyable, gamble=True):
  If unowned: resolve bet FIRST, then offer purchase.
  If owned by you or opponent: after normal rent/visit, also resolve a bet.

Bet: ~27% win $12–85 * multiplier; else lose $18–95 (owned-casino loss * 0.6). Mostly lose a little.


12. POLICE / TAX / BONUS / FREE / CLUB / DESERT
-----------------------------------------------
Police: pay 2% of net worth to bank (min $1). Visiting police ≠ jail.
Tax spaces: flat $100 or $150 to bank.
Free parking: +$25 * multiplier.
Lobby Day: +$50 * multiplier.
Club / desert: see politicians.


13. EXTORTION
-------------
Available when:
  You land on an Extort space, OR
  Chance “EXTORTION LICENSE” card
Charges this window = 1 + politicians//2
Click EXTORT then click a property tile (not your own).
Independent (unowned): take $40 (*1.5 if extort_boost) * multiplier
Owned by opponent: base = max(30, listed rent), *1.5 if boost, minus resist, * multiplier; opponent pays (may pawn politicians).
Each successful shake decrements charges. Politicians stay.
extort_boost consumed on next successful extort (from Chance masterclass).
AI: repeatedly extort highest-score targets (prefer opponent-owned, high rent) until charges empty.


14. CHANCE
----------
Label is Chance, never “supposin’” cards. Short punchlines.

Effects used:
  cash N          grant N * multiplier
  pay N           pay flat N
  pol 1           +1 politician
  whistle 120     pay 120 unless you have ≥1 politician
  go              teleport to 0 + GO payday
  jail            send to jail
  steal 75        take min(75*mult, victim cash)
  boost           next extort +50%
  extort_card     open extort window as if landed on Extort
  tax_group (g, per)     pay per * count owned in group (0 owned: flavor “fine leaves”)
  tax_groups dict        several groups
  pay_me_group (g, per)  collect per * count * multiplier

Include class penalties for: food+slum, vice, gambling, hospitality, wash, hype, wheels, pills, retail, oil, space.
Include paydays for wash and vice ownership.


15. AI (The Algorithm)
----------------------
Goal: bankrupt the human (0 cash and 0 politicians). No politician cap.
Prefers buying politicians over expensive late deeds.
Keeps a thin reserve (~$120–200) then dumps cash into politicians.
Buys a deed if cheap and cash remains, or if it already owns the group, unless it would starve politician shopping.
On politician space, buy while cash >= 400.
On extort / extort card, drain charges targeting the human.
After landing, act, then end turn automatically.


16. UI
------
Left/center: square board. Inner plaza title “MobbieLand” plus mode/dice/help lines.
Right panel “Ledgers of Sin”: each player cash, prop count, pols, multiplier, net worth, doubles streak, IN JAIL, current-turn marker.
“The Gossip Column”: wrapping log (~last 18 lines). Stop log above button row.
Buttons live in the panel bottom, SIZE WITH THE PANEL:
  Row1 equal thirds: ROLL | BUY DEED | END TURN
  Row2 half/half: BUY POLITICIAN $250 | EXTORT xN
  Heights/padding/font scale with panel w/h. Shrink label font if text overflows.
Tile text contrast: luminance >= 0.58 → dark ink, else light ink.
Human controls only on that player’s action/roll phase, not while tokens animate, not during AI turn.


17. AUDIO (optional)
--------------------
Generated tones (sine/square/whoosh) via numpy + pygame.sndarray after mixer init.
Events: roll, step, go, buy, rent, chance, jail, pol, extort, desert, club, doubles, lose_pol, bust, click, deny, gamble, police.
Any failure → no crash, no sound.


18. IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
------------------------
- One file is fine.
- Animation state machine: phase roll | moving | action | end
- keep_extort flag so Chance extort card is not wiped by land() cleanup
- Owner references are Player objects on each prop space
- Hot-seat uses the same buttons; current human is game.cur()
- Comedy copy: at least 10 jokes per space type listed in prior source (GO, jail visit, imprisoned, parking, police, chance, extort, clubs, dice, tax, bonus, buy-pol, every property)

RECREATE PRIORITY
-----------------
1. 40-space loop, non-overlapping corners, contrast text
2. Buy / rent / GO / jail / chance / politicians
3. Extort charges and lose condition
4. Multiplier table
5. Modes, R rematch, resizable UI, safe window save
6. AI politician rush
7. Jokes + optional SFX